# Arc Dark -- A SHIPPED SYSTEM THEME AND THE `default` THEME'S SOURCE since 2026-11-18 (architect, send
# Y: "arc_dark and 75 will be my default", "let the remote session make that the default"; the
# `default` row a copy of this file's, src/gui/theme_roles.h's THE LIST; the launcher icon's ground and
# ink this file's SurfaceArea and ControlForeground, apk/build_apk.sh). Shipped since 2026-11-17,
# session 140's arc (its look a scratch test of 2026-11-13, session 123, parked until then), WRITTEN BY
# HAND from the arc-theme sources, not converted
# from an .ask: THE ROLE VALUES ALONE, read from arc-theme's sass and xfwm4 assets (no file of arc-theme
# ships; THIRD_PARTY.md credits it). Source: jnsh/arc-theme (the fork Arch packages), commit
# 94ac8c7d67d68de0cc688bbd4c3105b9815b446e (2025-10-18), GPL-3.0, variant 'dark', transparency off:
# common/gtk-3.0/sass/_colors.scss, _common.scss and common/xfwm4/dark/assets.svg. Sass lighten /
# darken / mix resolved to sRGB bytes. Arc-Dark is dark throughout (no light content panel; Arc-Darker,
# which has them, not used). It carries the architect's rulings of sessions 123 and 140, below (his
# picks of 2026-11-14 and 2026-11-17).
# THE CLOSE RED: Arc-Dark's xfwm4 / headerbar close disc, wm_button_close_bg CC575D (hover D7787D,
# pressed BE3841), on THE CLIP LAMP ALONE (architect 2026-11-14, session 123: red reads as a warning
# or a close; the limiter lamp stays Arc's warning orange — the cards wear notifyd's grey and Arc's
# destructive red since send AA's stage D1, 2026-11-19, below). The playhead's head is Arc's
# fg D3DAE3, the icon glyph color; the markers' chips the accent, Arc's selection blue 5294E2
# (architect 2026-11-17, session 140: "the marker should take selection blue ... the playhead can be the
# glyph color"), Arc's own numbers at bright_mix 100 (the default 75 mixes them toward the ground,
# src/gui/theme_roles.h's THE BRIGHT MIX). THE CANVAS ON ARC'S CONTENT BASE 404552,
# Thunar's list (architect 2026-11-17: "Thunar's is the official"; the ruler wears the canvas's tone, a
# derivation rule, not this file).
# One line per role:
#   SurfaceArea                 2F343F  $header_bg (also wm_bg): Arc's headerbar / titlebar, the darkest main chrome
#   Desktop                     353945  $dark_sidebar_bg (= text_view_bg): between header_bg and bg_color
#   SurfaceBackground           444A58  $button_bg (lighten($base_color, 2%)); a headerbar button, 40 % lighten(header_bg, 22%) over header_bg, is 424958
#   ControlContrastFrame        21252B  the xfwm4 frame's edge fill (assets.svg); _common.scss's dark window outline,
#                                       darken($header_bg, 7%), resolves to about 20232B
#   ControlForeground           D3DAE3  $fg_color
#   TextDisabled                7E838F  $insensitive_fg_color (fg at 45 % alpha) over $bg_color, read flat
#   BackgroundClip              666A74  $wm_icon_unfocused_bg, the titlebar glyph of an unfocused window
#   ViewCheckControlEnabledOn   5294E2  $selected_bg_color, THE ACCENT
#   RangeDefault                D3DAE3  $fg_color: the playhead's head, near-white (above)
#   StandbySelectionBackground  5294E2  $selected_bg_color (Arc has one selection)
#   StandbySelectionForeground  FFFFFF  $selected_fg_color
#   SelectionBackground         A9CAF1  $link_color (lighten($selected_bg_color, 20%)): the lighter list press
#   SelectionForeground         2F343F  $wm_icon_close_bg (= header_bg): Arc's dark print on a colored disc
#   Alert                       F27835  $warning_color: the limiter lamp (the cards' face until send AA's stage D1)
#   WaveformColor               262A33  $header_border (darken($header_bg, 4%)): the ink one step above the stem
#                                       (ControlContrastFrame 21252B), CIELAB L* 2.50 (the stem-over-ink rule's 3.61, ballpark)
#   DetailViewBackground        404552  $base_color: Arc's content base, Thunar's list view (the canvas and the ruler)
#   DetailGridTiles             404552  the same, opaque: the canvas is DetailViewBackground itself
#   TakeLaneTrackNotHighlighted 2B2E3959 $borders_color (darken($bg_color, 6%)), Arc's separator, at 35 % over the canvas -> 393D49
#   ViewCheckControlDisabledOff 7F8591  an insensitive button's drawing, measured on his Arc-Dark desktop (shot B3b,
#                                       2026-11-18): the disabled key's glyph (architect 2026-11-19, send Z; 666A74,
#                                       $wm_icon_unfocused_bg, the inactive titlebar glyph, before it)
#   ScrollbarInnerHandle        767B87  Arc's scrollbar slider, mix($fg_color, $bg_color, 40%) (the trim span's pill)
#   ScrollbarInnerTrack         3E434F  Arc's scrollbar trough, $_scrollbar_bg_color = darken($base_color, 1%)
#                                       (the trim bar's lane; a NEW required role, session 140's plan)
#   DetailViewRulerMarkings     D3DAE366 Arc's scale marks, gtkalpha(currentColor, 0.4) of $fg_color, over the ruler (the canvas) -> 7B818C
#   StandardVuMeter/Maximum     CC575D  $wm_button_close_bg, THE CLOSE RED (the clip lamp)
#   ClipBorder                  2B2E39  $borders_color: Thunar's pane border, the well's frame and its lines (a NEW
#                                       required role, architect 2026-11-17, D2)
# OUR OWN ROLES (not Live's; src/gui/theme_roles.h's THE FORMAT), architect 2026-11-19, send Z, the Arc page:
#   WindowBackground            383C4A  $bg_color: THE BODY TONE, the ground of everything under the title bar
#                                       (SurfaceArea, $header_bg, stays the title bar's)
#   TitleForeground             AFB8C5  xfwm4's title text on the title bar
#   SidebarForeground           BAC3CF  $dark_sidebar_fg: the marker labels' ink, the tooltip's words, a normal card's
#                                       words and glyph
# OUR OWN FILLS, CARRYING THEIR ALPHA (the 8-digit word's last byte reaches the painter, the box painted at it over
# whatever lies under; src/gui/theme_roles.h's CARRIED block), send AA's stage D1, 2026-11-19 (DESIGN §6 / §9, his
# "good to build" on tmp/sendZ/VIEW/Z_07); .95 is the byte F2 (242.25 rounded, .949):
#   TooltipBackground           4B5162F2 $osd_bg_color, rgba(75, 81, 98, .95) (G3:1430): the tooltip's box
#   CardBackground              353945F2 xfce4-notifyd's bubble under Arc ($dark_sidebar_bg at .95): a normal (timed) card
#   CardStandingBackground      F04A50F2 $destructive_color, button.destructive-action (G3:216), at .95: a standing
#                                       (critical) card, A BRIGHT TONE (C0444C at bright_mix 75); its words and glyph
#                                       StandbySelectionForeground FFFFFF
SurfaceArea=2F343F
Desktop=353945
